    "comment": "Scrolling belt. belt_top.png is a 16x128 vertical strip of 8 frames; chevrons advance toward -Y (the exit side / +Z of the base model). frametime 2 = brisk Factorio-style scroll (lower = faster). Fixed client speed, not RPM. Model y-rotation per facing rotates this face too, so the scroll always runs toward travel direction; up/down tilt with the ramp."
